      ],
      "prompt": "Left thin strip (the ring): plain dark steel (#3A4250). The wrap (from the ring to the next zone line): a black crosshatch knurled grip (#101218) with a few thin glowing blue lightning veins (#3DB8FF). The butt sleeve (between the two zone lines on the right): dark storm-grey steel with glowing electric-blue branching lightning and two raised polished silver angular chevron shards (#C8CED8) pointing to the right, one above the middle row and one below. The very thin strip at the far right: plain black."
    }
